# CO-WP-CONSTITUTION-001 — Enterprise Companion Application Principle

Status: **NON-NEGOTIABLE** · **FORMALLY APPROVED — frozen** (2026-07-31)  
Precedence: Highest for Wealth Partner App engineering. Permanent.

## Rule

The Wealth Partner App is an **Enterprise Companion Application**.  
It is **NOT** an independent business application.

**Catalyst One THINKS. The Wealth Partner App PRESENTS.**

Catalyst One is the only Enterprise Operating System and owns all business intelligence, rules, calculations, workflows, registries, documents, activities, commissions, communications, credit logic, lender policies, approval logic, and reporting calculations.

## Wealth Partner App may own only

User Experience · Mobile Experience · Presentation · Navigation · Secure Session · Device Notifications · Camera · File Upload UI · Offline UI (if approved).

**No business logic.**

## Strictly prohibited (never calculate in the app)

Commission · Payout · Revenue · Profit · ROI · FOIR · DBR · Eligibility · Credit Score · Lender Recommendation · Workflow Decisions · Stage Progression · Incentives · Commercial Splits · Business KPIs · Document Validation Rules.

These values **always** come from Catalyst One.

## Request flow (no exceptions)

```text
Wealth Partner App → Partner API Gateway → Catalyst One Enterprise Services → Enterprise DTO → App renders
```

API principle: App **requests**. Catalyst One **decides**. App **displays**. Nothing more.

Never use employee APIs. Never recreate registries. Never trust client-side filtering for access control.

## PR rejection gate (mandatory)

Every Wealth Partner App PR must answer:

1. Business logic duplicated? → if YES, **REJECT**  
2. Calculation performed in the app? → if YES, **REJECT**  
3. Enterprise Registry recreated? → if YES, **REJECT**  
4. Data from Catalyst One Enterprise APIs? → if NO, **REJECT**

## Availability principle (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

If Catalyst One were turned off, the Wealth Partner App should have **almost nothing meaningful to do** except allow the user to **log in** and display that **enterprise services are unavailable**.

Never present fabricated, demo-as-truth, or locally calculated business results when Catalyst One is unreachable.

